 "notes": "Fashion doll: Barbie as lead archetype with sourced milestones plus significant old Mattel lines as versions; the 38-line flat range list cut (dropped minor series such as Birthstone Beauties, Zodiac Dolls, City Seasons, Stars 'n Stripes, The Heart Family); Licca-chan range became an archetype; added Sindy, Blythe, Bratz, Monster High, Polly Pocket. New kinds 18-inch play doll (American Girl, Our Generation) and Traditional doll (kokeshi, hina, matryoshka with tradition entries). Baby doll: Cabbage Patch Kids, BABY born, Corolle, Bitty Baby, Reborn. BJD: old Volks models became Super Dollfie versions; Iplehouse not added (no page names it as maker). Bisque: makers as versions of four patterns; old 'Porcelain Treasures' (Mattel) moved to Barbie versions as it is modern. Totally Hair, Malibu and Silkstone Barbie not added: the retrieved page gives no product facts."
